{
  "version": "2026.05.25.8",
  "_description": "Innovo Apple TV icon library. Served on managed devices at /icons/<name>.png via nginx, read by the Elan driver and any other app that needs Apple TV app artwork.",
  "_changelog": [
    "2026-05-23.6: Repurposed from apple-tv-apps.json (apps[]) to manifest.json (icons-only). Apple TV app discovery is now handled natively by pyatv PR #2855; this repo's only job is to host the icon library + ship deltas to devices.",
    "2026-05-23.7: Added City TV (citytv.png). Replaced HBO Max icon with operator-supplied newer version. 74 icons total.",
    "2026-05-23.8: hbomax.png byte-modified for delta-detection test (harmless tEXt PNG chunk added; image visually identical).",
    "2026-05-23.9: Added Global TV (globaltv.png). 75 icons total.",
    "2026.05.23.10: updated 7 (chillio.png, hallmark.png, nasa.png, spectrum.png, citytv.png, globaltv.png, hbomax.png).",
    "2026.05.23.11: updated 1 (netflix.png).",
    "2026.05.23.12: updated 1 (netflix.png).",
    "2026.05.23.13: updated 4 (chillio.png, nasa.png, hbomax.png, netflix.png).",
    "2026.05.23.14: updated 4 (chillio.png, hallmark.png, globaltv.png, netflix.png).",
    "2026.05.23.15: updated 1 (netflix.png).",
    "2026.05.23.16: updated 1 (netflix.png).",
    "2026.05.23.17: updated 1 (hulu.png).",
    "2026.05.23.18: updated 1 (disney.png).",
    "2026.05.23.19: added 1 (aljazeeraenglish.png); updated 1 (spotify.png).",
    "2026.05.23.20: alias icons (disneyplus.png + disney+.png from disney.png; aljazeera.png from aljazeeraenglish.png). Same content, additional filenames so device-side UI/Elan callers using any of these names get the artwork.",
    "2026.05.25.1: added 2 (mbcshahid.png, tod.png).",
    "2026.05.25.2: added 1 (smarterspro.png).",
    "2026.05.25.3: added 1 (splayerpro.png).",
    "2026.05.25.4: added 1 (smartersplayerlite.png).",
    "2026.05.25.5: added 1 (000player.png).",
    "2026.05.25.6: added 3 (hellokitty.png, livescreens.png, sing.png)."
  ],
